3,"Nyakyusa, Ngonde in Tanzania people group profile | Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/14078/TZ,"Learn about the Nyakyusa, Ngonde in Tanzania people group. Profiles include statistics, text, photo, map, progress indicator and language resources.They speak Nyakyusa-Ngonde and live mainly in Tanzania. There is also a good population of them in Malawi.",Nyakyusa-Ngonde,Niger-Congo
